    <text>
        <body>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_16b8738b" type="brand-elements">
            <ab><lb />
            <name type="brand">
               Welte-Mignon
            </name></ab>
         </div>
         <div facs="#eSc_textblock_1f92a58e" type="brand-elements">
            <ab><lb />
            <hi rendition="#uc #g2">
               <seg ana="#virtual_presence" type="slogan" resp="#np">
                  The Master's Fingers on Your Piano
              </seg>
            </hi></ab>
         </div>

         <div facs="#eSc_textblock_f12fe344" type="illustration">
            <ab><seg ana="#listening" resp="#np" type="topic">
                <figure>
                    <desc>
                        Painting of Pachmann sitting at a piano. Three men in the background observing him.
                    </desc>
                </figure>
            </seg></ab>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_be99ecd4">
            <ab><lb />
            <seg ana="#immortality" resp="#np" type="topic">
                <hi rendition="#i">Through You I Live Forever</hi>
            </seg></ab>
         </div>
         <div facs="#eSc_textblock_c488bbeb">
            <quote type="testimonial">
                <lb />"BRAVO! BRAVO! <name type="brand">Welte Mignon*</name>! You have
                <lb />given me one of the greatest
                experiences of my
                <lb />life. You have made my fondest dream come true-
                <lb />the dream of a perfect recording method and a re-
                <lb />producing mechanism
                <seg ana="#immortality">
                    thru which my playing as
                    an
                    <lb />interpretative artist might live forever.
                </seg>
                You are my
                <lb />undying 'alter ego'–thru you my own invisible hands
                <lb />render the spell of my <persName type="composer">Chopin</persName>, my
                <persName type="composer">Liszt</persName>. You have
                <lb />my unqualified endorsement.
                <seg ana="#immortality">
                    <hi rendition="#i">Thru you I live forever."</hi>
                </seg>
            </quote>
         </div>
         <div facs="#eSc_textblock_6aa6819d">
            <signed><lb />
            <hi rendition="#i">
                <persName corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116014490">V. de Pachmann</persName>
            </hi></signed>
         </div>
         <div facs="#eSc_textblock_5b251767">
            <ab><hi rendition="#i">
                <lb />A letter from the great
                <lb />
                <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116014490">Vladimir de Pachmann</persName>,
                the idol of
                <lb />his time, the most celebrated
                <lb />pianist of a century; rejuve-
                <lb />nated at 75, and now playing
                <lb />"as no one ever played before."
            </hi></ab>
         </div>
         <div facs="#eSc_textblock_e4393655">
            <ab><lb />Installed invisibly in any piano,
            <seg ana="#exact_reproduction" resp="#np" type="topic">
                <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon* Reproducing Action</name> makes that
                <lb />piano reproduce with absolute perfection the playing of the master pianists.
            </seg> The
            <lb />Library contains thousands of beautiful recordings. You can choose from 112
            <lb />standard makes of pianos that now install the
            <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon* Reproducing Action</name>.
            <lb />Send for the beautiful art brochure</ab>
         </div>
         <div facs="#eSc_textblock_9d2e8e27">
            <ab><hi rendition="#c">
                <lb />
                <orgName key="auto.pneumatic.action">The AUTO PNEUMATIC ACTION CO.</orgName>,
                <address>
                  <addrLine>653 West 51st Street, New York</addrLine>
                </address>
                <lb /><persName>WILLIAM C. HEATON</persName>, President
            </hi>
            <hi rendition="#right #smaller"><hi rendition="#smaller">
                <lb />*Licensed under original <name type="brand">Welte Mignon</name> patents
            </hi></hi></ab>
         </div>
        </body>
